      "content": "hey so i got this weird red patch on my leg. it started as a small spot like a few days ago but its getting way bigger and looks kinda angry/shiny. it feels warm when i touch it too. i think i might have just picked up some ringworm from the gym or something. do u think i should just use some antifungal cream or is there something else i can do at home to make it go away fast?",
